      "t": "Sitting in Tamara Ivanovna's office, Viktor Petrovich politely answers her questions assuming she wants to book a restaurant banquet. When he realizes Elena tricked him into seeing a therapist for his explosive temper, he erupts in fury until Tamara proposes a simple technique.",
